exports[`accountDeletionCompleted > renders accessible HTML and a plain-text alternative 1`] = `
"Your Example Air account has been deleted

Example Air https://air.example.test


Your account has been deleted

Your Example Air account was deleted on October 18, 2026. Your personal data has been removed.

Records the law requires us to keep, such as payment records, are kept without your personal details.

Thank you for being part of Example Air.

----------------------------------------

You are receiving this email because of your account on Example Air.

Questions? Write to hello@air.example.test.

Example Air runs on free software. Get the source code https://forge.example.test/air/commonair/tree/0123abcd."
`;

