exports[`dmcaCounterNoticeForwarded > renders accessible HTML and a plain-text alternative 1`] = `
"Counter-notice received for your copyright notice DMCA-2026-0091

Example Air https://air.example.test


The uploader sent a counter-notice

The person whose material was removed under your copyright (DMCA) notice DMCA-2026-0091 sent the counter-notice below. We are forwarding it to you as the law requires.

Name

Ada

Address

1 Example Street, Springfield

Telephone

+1 555 0100

Their statement

I recorded this performance myself and hold the rights to it.

Signature

/s/ Ada

Material the counter-notice covers

https://air.example.test/ada_plays/clip/sample

Counter-notice received

October 18, 2026 at 2:30 PM UTC

Material will be restored after

November 3, 2026 at 2:30 PM UTC

The sender stated, under penalty of perjury, that they believe in good faith the material was removed by mistake or misidentification. They consented to the jurisdiction of the federal district court for their address (or, outside the United States, any judicial district in which we may be found) and agreed to accept service of process from you or your agent.

We will restore the material after November 3, 2026 at 2:30 PM UTC unless, before then, you tell our designated agent at dmca@air.example.test that you have filed a court action seeking to restrain the sender from the infringing activity.

----------------------------------------

You are receiving this email because of your account on Example Air.

Questions? Write to hello@air.example.test.

Example Air runs on free software. Get the source code https://forge.example.test/air/commonair/tree/0123abcd."
`;

