exports[`enforcementStatement > renders accessible HTML and a plain-text alternative 1`] = `
"Statement of reasons: Your stream was limited while a moderator reviews it

Example Air https://air.example.test


Statement of reasons

The wording of this statement comes from a draft notice that has not been reviewed by a lawyer yet. It may change.

On October 18, 2026 at 2:30 PM UTC we took an action about your stream. This statement says what we did, why, and how you can challenge it.

Reference

SR-3F9A21C7

What we restricted

Your stream was limited while a moderator reviews it

Until

No end date: it stays in place until it is lifted

Where

Everywhere Example Air is available

What led to it

Automated checks found weapons in content captured on October 18, 2026 at 2:30 PM UTC, at or above the threshold of 95% set for automatic action.

How it came to our attention

Our own checks or moderators

Automated means

Software detected it. Software made the decision, without a person.

Rule or law relied on

Our community guidelines: Dangerous weapons (safety.weapons@1)

What the rule says

Content that shows weapons in a way that threatens people or puts them at serious risk is not allowed.

How to challenge this decision

You can appeal on your appeals page while you are signed in. If you cannot reach it, write to abuse@air.example.test and quote the reference above.

If you think we got it wrong, you can appeal from your account's appeals page.

You can also take the dispute to an out-of-court dispute settlement body where one is available to you, or to the courts.

Open your appeals page https://air.example.test/settings/appeals

----------------------------------------

You are receiving this email because of your account on Example Air.

Questions? Write to hello@air.example.test.

Example Air runs on free software. Get the source code https://forge.example.test/air/commonair/tree/0123abcd."
`;

